- Verify: fails closed: an uninferable call keeps the template, is diagnosed, and the verifier counts it
   - Expected: stats.specializations_created equals `0)  # oracle: 0 — named expected value from the requirement`
   - Expected: stats.unresolved_generic_calls equals `1)  # oracle: 1 — named expected value from the requirement`
   - Expected: diags.len() equals `1)  # oracle: 1 — named expected value from the requirement`
   - Expected: count_named(om, "ident") equals `1`
